# Keep LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# install.mjs records a content hash of each placed file to tell "you edited
# this" from "this is stale". If git rewrote line endings per platform, the same
# source would hash differently on Windows and Linux and every file would look
# locally edited after a fresh clone.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
